tests/vectors/rfc9180.json (in Sew's repository; not in the published package) is a subset of
the RFC 9180 test vectors (the base-mode vectors of the suites this crate supports), as
published with RFC 9180 and carried by the hpke crate (MIT OR Apache-2.0).

HPKE is done by the hpke crate (rozbb/rust-hpke, MIT OR Apache-2.0); no code of hpke-rs
(MPL-2.0) is used or derived from.
